<title>USA: ILLINOIS DIRECT HOGS $1.00 LOWER - USDA.</title>
<headline>ILLINOIS DIRECT HOGS $1.00 LOWER - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 lower. Demand moderate to light. Top $55.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs.  54.50-55.50</p>
<p>US 2-3 230-260 lbs.  53.50-54.50</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to weak. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-400 lbs. 42.00-44.00</p>
<p>	 400-500 lbs. 43.00-46.00</p>
<p>	 500-600 lbs. 46.00-48.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs. 47.50-49.00</p>
</text>
